{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object in sight, then approach & take it. Move to target in order to complete the task. Explore area if failed. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToTarget    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
